ready: 1
kind: quality
id: agents.quality.config-preserved
display_id: QC-AGENTS-CONFIG
module: agents
title: Runtime configuration is never lost
applies_to: [agents.seq.setup, agents.seq.remove, agents.rule.settings-merge]
measure: Owner-written entries present before setup and after setup, and after setup followed by removal
target: Every owner-written entry survives setup and removal unchanged, and a backup exists for every change.
